    rd_single_desc_full: "A cosy room for one with a comfortable 80\u00d7200 bed and a private bathroom with shower. The windows face a quiet, dead-end street with virtually no car traffic \u2014 a guarantee of silence and a good night's sleep in the heart of the old town. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_double_desc_full: "An elegant double room in a historic tenement house, with a private bathroom and shower. In every room of this category the 160\u00d7200 bed can be split into two separate 80\u00d7200 mattresses \u2014 these are the only rooms in the hotel offering this option; please let us know when booking. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_bal_desc_full: "A spacious double room with a private balcony opening onto the river. Morning coffee in the fresh air and evening sunsets over the water \u2014 that is what sets this room apart. Private bathroom with shower. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_view_desc_full: "A double room with a river view \u2014 water right outside the window, in a quiet corner of Opole's old town. Private bathroom with shower. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_mur_desc_full: "One of two rooms with an exposed, historic Prussian (half-timbered) wall \u2014 a wooden frame filled with brick meeting modern glazing. The river view completes the picture. Private bathroom with shower. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_superior_desc_full: "A double room with a separate seating area \u2014 a comfortable sofa and armchairs \u2014 and a sweeping river panorama. Ideal both for relaxing and for remote work. Private bathroom with shower. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    rd_apartment_desc_full: "The largest interior in the hotel \u2014 an apartment combining a hallway, a spacious living room and a bedroom with a river view. Bathroom with a shower and a freestanding bathtub. A good choice for a weekend for two or a longer stay. Every room comes as standard with a TV with Chromecast, air conditioning, a safe, fast Wi-Fi, a coffee maker, a work desk and a paid minibar.",
    parking_nav: "\u2693 Navigate to hotel parking",
    parking_nav_short: "\u2192 How to reach the parking?"
